{# Avatar partial. Reused by the sidebar footer chip and the self-service
   profile page. Renders the user's uploaded photo (avatarFilename, set
   via vich/uploader-bundle on /account/profile-settings/edit-profile)
   when there is one; otherwise falls back to the initials placeholder
   (colour + initials computed by UserAvatarExtension).

   Contract:
     @var user  App\Entity\Administration\User  the user to render an avatar for
     @var size  string           'sm' (default, h-10 w-10) or 'lg' (h-24 w-24)

   Colour is deterministic per email (crc32 mod palette length) so the
   same user always gets the same colour across pages and refreshes.
   Initials: first two chars of `name`, fallback to first two chars of
   `email`. Uppercased.
#}
{% set dim = size == 'lg' ? 'h-24 w-24 text-2xl' : 'h-10 w-10 text-sm' %}
{% if user.avatarFilename %}
    <img src="{{ asset('uploads/avatars/' ~ user.avatarFilename) }}"
         alt=""
         class="flex {{ dim }} shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover select-none">
{% else %}
    <span class="flex {{ dim }} shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-{{ user_avatar_color(user) }} font-semibold text-stone-50 select-none"
          aria-hidden="true">{{ user_initials(user) }}</span>
{% endif %}